// K2: Estimated cost per agent and day
// Tokens priced with your price table in AgentCost. UnpricedCalls counts model calls whose model is not in the table, so you know when a number is incomplete.
AgentCost(30d)
| summarize TotalTokens = sum(TotalTokens), InputCost = round(sum(InputCost), 4), OutputCost = round(sum(OutputCost), 4),
            Cost = round(sum(Cost), 4), UnpricedCalls = countif(PriceMissing) by Day = bin(timestamp, 1d), Agent
| order by Day desc, Cost desc
